	<string>用于发现并连接您配置的局域网设备和媒体服务器。Discover and connect to local-network devices and media servers that you configure.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>用于获取当前位置并展示实时天气信息。Get the current location and display real-time weather information.</string>
